WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.420 --> 00:00:03.690
Why is that we bother doing anything?

00:00:03.690 --> 00:00:11.160
Why is it that we work our whole life building
and creating things beyond the necessary minimum?

00:00:11.160 --> 00:00:14.570
Developing careers and businesses.

00:00:14.570 --> 00:00:16.430
Innovating technologies.

00:00:16.430 --> 00:00:18.220
And making art.

00:00:18.220 --> 00:00:24.570
All things that we work so hard for, just
to end up saying goodbye forever to them when

00:00:24.570 --> 00:00:26.680
we pass on.

00:00:26.680 --> 00:00:33.011
The reason why it might seem foolish to bother
working towards creating anything, is the

00:00:33.011 --> 00:00:38.589
same reason why we do: the awareness of death.

00:00:38.589 --> 00:00:45.219
As a creature that can ponder and foresee
the imminence of its own mortality, we are

00:00:45.219 --> 00:00:51.530
compelled to not only survive the here and
now, but to extend our existence beyond the

00:00:51.530 --> 00:00:56.969
limited timeline of our perishable mind and
body.

00:00:56.969 --> 00:01:03.179
Because of death, we find great fulfillment
in the process of bringing things from within

00:01:03.179 --> 00:01:07.060
our self, outside of our self.

00:01:07.060 --> 00:01:14.600
Manifesting things into reality that would
not exist if it were not for our sole existence.

00:01:14.600 --> 00:01:20.009
Because it is this process that makes us feel
like we can beat death.

00:01:20.009 --> 00:01:22.950
That we can somehow live beyond it.

00:01:22.950 --> 00:01:27.680
That our existence can have meaning in spite
of it.

00:01:27.680 --> 00:01:34.149
During our short lifetime, we want nothing
more than to leave our individual fingerprint

00:01:34.149 --> 00:01:35.760
on reality.

00:01:35.760 --> 00:01:39.869
To create a ripple that floods into the eternal.

00:01:39.869 --> 00:01:46.890
Because the concept of accomplishing this
is what allows us to truly tolerate the foresight

00:01:46.890 --> 00:01:48.100
of our own death.

00:01:48.100 --> 00:01:53.750
It is what gives us the hope that we are connected
to the infinite.

00:01:53.750 --> 00:01:57.579
And it is this that we should pursue.

00:01:57.579 --> 00:02:04.049
Do that which fulfills this and makes you
feel, even if just momentarily, like you are

00:02:04.049 --> 00:02:05.439
god.

00:02:05.439 --> 00:02:08.149
Do what is unique to you.

00:02:08.149 --> 00:02:11.230
What is innovative and impactful.

00:02:11.230 --> 00:02:12.350
Say the unsaid.

00:02:12.350 --> 00:02:14.690
Do the undone.

00:02:14.690 --> 00:02:20.090
Bring your thoughts, ideas, and sense of life
into reality.

00:02:20.090 --> 00:02:24.040
Do something that can live on in your name.

00:02:24.040 --> 00:02:55.260
Because it just might, and that’s a pretty
cool reason to bother doing anything.

